# 🌿 FloraScan AI - Plant Disease Diagnostic System

FloraScan AI is a computer vision application built with **PyTorch** and **Streamlit** that diagnoses plant leaf health and classifies agricultural crop diseases in real-time.

---

## 🚀 Key Features

* **Multi-Engine Support**: Switch between a lightweight **Custom 3-Block CNN** (95.83% accuracy) and a **Pre-trained ResNet18** transfer learning model (94.00% accuracy).
* **Confidence Breakdown**: Displays diagnosis probabilities with interactive bar charts.
* **Modular Design**: Structured for multi-crop expansion beyond the active Solanaceae (Tomato) module.

---

## 🛠️ Project Structure

```text
├── app.py                  # Streamlit web interface and prediction logic
├── requirements.txt        # Python package dependencies
├── best_custom_cnn.pth     # Custom CNN trained model weights
├── best_resnet18.pth       # ResNet18 trained model weights
├── .gitignore              # Files ignored by Git control
└── README.md               # Project documentation